"<!--\n"
"The _tags/tagsindex.md file is auto-generated by the sphinx-tags extension. "
"Its purpose is for you to include it in your table of contents so that tags "
"appear in the side bar.\n"
"\n"
"However, in this project we don't want to expose tags in the side bar, at "
"least for the time being. The file isn't included in any ToC. That causes a "
"build issue because every file has to be included somewhere.\n"
"\n"
"Rather than suppress the build warnings, I'm including the tags index in "
"this mock file. It's configured as an \"orhpan\", which tells the build "
"system that this file isn't supposed to be included anywhere.\n"
"\n"
"In theory, I could also add the orphan configuration directly into _tags/"
"tagsindex.md. This is difficult, though, due to that file being auto-"
"generated at every build. Having this static Markdown file is easier to "
"maintain than adjusting the Makefile and the Sphinx build process.\n"
"-->\n"
msgstr ""
